matching); the outer tee is drained at exit. Detached with `setsid nohup`; the Planner arms a Monitor on the state file.
 
 ## 5. Evaluation protocol (cells)
 
 Common flags for every generative cell: `--cond-method vanilla --cond-autocast bf16 --cfg-scale 1.0 --steps 1 --record-per-scene --record-stream --expected-stream-count <split size> --dump-scored-waveforms /media/diskstation/yixunhu/FLAC/exp25_pred_waveforms` (the ROOT; cell dir `<ROOT>/<metrics stem>`, v9); batch 64; EMA (`weights_source: ema` recorded). `--frame-avg-angles` is NOT passed (inert under vanilla; record `null`). Evaluator pin = one commit for every cell of the campaign (recorded `source_sha`).
 
